# Bulk formatting-only commits — ignored by git blame.
#
# To activate locally:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Add the full 40-character SHA of any commit that only reformats code
# (e.g. a clang-format -i sweep) so that git blame skips over it and
# points to the commit with the substantive change instead.
#
# Example:
# abc123def456...  # clang-format sweep YYYY-MM-DD
